     "description": "Semiconductor Manufacturing International Corporation operates as an investment holding entity, primarily focused on the computer-aided design, production, evaluation, assembly, and distribution of integrated circuits (ICs). Its market presence extends across North America, China, the wider Asian region, Hong Kong, and Eurasia. The company also engages in the technical research, development, manufacturing, and sale of semiconductor masks, in addition to offering semiconductor foundry and technological services. Furthermore, it is involved in the construction, operation, and management of residential accommodations. SMIC provides comprehensive 'one-stop' support, encompassing design, intellectual property assistance, and photomask manufacturing, alongside marketing and private educational services. Incorporated in 2000, its corporate headquarters are situated in Shanghai, People's Republic of China.",
